  "notes": "{性格|せいかく} refers to a person's inherent personality traits.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {性格|せいかく}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦いい→いい：00118_ii⟧/⟦{悪|わる}い→悪い：00908_warui⟧ (good/bad personality)\n- {性格|せいかく}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{合|あ}う→合う：10466_au⟧/⟦{合|あ}わない→合う：10466_au⟧ (personalities match/don't match)\n- {性格|せいかく}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{変|か}わる→変わる：00714_kawaru⟧ (personality changes)\n- {性格|せいかく}⟦{診断|しんだん}→診断：04209_shindan⟧ (personality test)\n- ⟦{明|あか}るい→明るい：00616_akarui⟧{性格|せいかく} (cheerful personality)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {性格|せいかく}: personality (inherent character traits)\n- ⟦{人格|じんかく}→人格：11427_jinkaku⟧: character (moral quality, personhood)\n- ⟦{個性|こせい}→個性：11536_kosei⟧: individuality (unique characteristics)\n\nWATCH OUT:\n- {性格|せいかく}: personality, character\n- ⟦{正確|せいかく}→正確：03372_seikaku⟧: accurate, precise",
